================================================================================

PROJECT TITLE: College Management System

PROJECT OBJECTIVE:
------------------
To develop a comprehensive web-based college management system that streamlines
administrative tasks, student information management, academic processes, and
communication between administrators, students, and faculty members.

PROBLEM STATEMENT:
------------------
Traditional college management involves manual record-keeping, paper-based
processes, and scattered information systems which lead to:
- Inefficient data management and retrieval
- Difficulty in tracking student performance and attendance
- Delayed communication between stakeholders
- Errors in fee calculations and payment tracking
- Lack of real-time academic information access

Our College Management System addresses these challenges by providing a unified
digital platform for all college operations.

TECHNOLOGIES USED:
------------------

Frontend:
- React.js (JavaScript framework for building user interfaces)
- CSS3 (Styling and responsive design)
- Vite (Build tool for faster development)

Backend:
- Node.js (JavaScript runtime environment)
- Express.js (Web application framework)
- RESTful API architecture

Database:
- MySQL (Relational database management system)
- JSON Web Tokens (JWT) for authentication

Additional Technologies:
- File upload middleware (Multer)
- Email notification system
- Session-based authentication
- Role-based access control (Admin, Student, Professor)

