SAMPLE DATA OPERATIONS:
------------------------

1. Student Admission Flow:
   - Student fills admission form
   - Admin reviews application
   - Student is enrolled in courses
   - Student receives login credentials
   - Student accesses dashboard

2. Fee Payment Flow:
   - Admin creates fee record
   - Student views fee details
   - Student initiates payment
   - Payment gateway integration
   - Receipt generation

3. Grade Entry Flow:
   - Professor logs in
   - Selects course and exam
   - Enters marks for students
   - System calculates grades
   - Students view results

